      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Glimmer knew this would be her only chance to escape. Her only chance to do something, anything with her life. After all, it wasnâ€™t as if she would become queen of Brightmoon when her mother could survive and regenerate after any attack against her. No, she would be a princess eternal if she didnâ€™t leave to become something of value.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What good is a princess who cannot protect, when there are hunters out there in need of fresh blood?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
